@startuml HU04_Publicar_Solicitud_Prestamo
title HU-04 — Publicar Solicitud de Préstamo\nDIP (Colateral/Oráculo) + SRP (LTV) + Factory Method (Sprint 1 · DeFi360)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Prestatario"                    as User
boundary    "Frontend (React)"              as UI
control     "loanController"                as LC
participant "CollateralService\n(DIP IPriceOracle)" as CS
participant "priceOracle (Singleton)"       as ORA
participant "LTVCalculatorService"          as LTV
participant "<<interface>>\nILoanFactory"   as ILF
participant "FixedRate / VariableRate\nLoanFactory" as LF
database    "PostgreSQL\n(Offer, Loan)"     as DB

autonumber

note over LC, CS
  loanController.requestLoan(collateralService = new CollateralService(priceOracle)).
  CollateralService depende de IPriceOracle (DIP). LTVCalculatorService aísla la
  aritmética financiera (SRP). LoanFactory crea el Loan (Factory Method) en el match.
end note

== Solicitar préstamo (POST /api/loans/request) ==

User -> UI : { amount, duration, collateralType, collateralAmount }
UI -> LC : POST /api/loans/request (JWT)

LC -> CS : calculateValue(collateralType, collateralAmount)
CS -> ORA : getPrice(collateralType)  (DIP)
ORA --> CS : precio (caché TTL)
CS --> LC : collateralValue

alt collateralValue < amount
    LC --> UI : 400 { Colateral insuficiente, ltv }
    UI --> User : Error de colateral
else colateral suficiente
    LC -> DB : Offer.create(type='borrow', status='active')
    DB --> LC : offer
    LC --> UI : 201 { success, offer }
    UI --> User : Solicitud publicada en Marketplace
end

== Calcular LTV (POST /api/loans/calculate-ltv) ==

User -> UI : { loanAmount, collateralAmount, collateralType }
UI -> LC : POST /api/loans/calculate-ltv
LC -> CS : calculateValue(...)
CS -> ORA : getPrice(...)
ORA --> CS : precio
CS --> LC : collateralValue
LC -> LTV : calculateLTV(loanAmount, collateralValue)
LTV --> LC : { ratio, riskLevel, isHealthy, message }
LC --> UI : 200 { ltv, riskLevel, isHealthy }

== Financiar solicitud (POST /api/loans/match/:id) — crea el Loan ==

User -> UI : Acepta solicitud { rateType }
UI -> LC : POST /api/loans/match/{id} (JWT)
LC -> ILF : createFromOffer(offer, lenderId, borrowerId, rateType)
ILF -> LF : createFromOffer(...)  (fixed | variable)
LF -> DB : Loan.create(rateType, remainingBalance, ...)
DB --> LF : loan
LF --> LC : loan
LC -> DB : update Wallets (bloqueo/transferencia) + Offer.status='matched'
LC --> UI : 200 { loan, rateType }

note over User, DB
  QA: src/test/CollateralService.test.js (DIP),
  LTVRiskStrategy.test.js, simulateController.test.js.
end note

@enduml
